<title>BULGARIA: SOCCER-CSKA BEAT LEVSKI SOFIA 3-1 IN BULGARIAN CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CSKA BEAT LEVSKI SOFIA 3-1 IN BULGARIAN CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>CSKA beat Levski Sofia 3-1 (halftime 1-0) in the Bulgarian Cup final on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>CSKA - Stefan Lulchev 9, Petar Zhabov 48, Milen Petkov 58</p>
<p>Levski Sofia - Stanimir Gospodinov 51</p>
